                            <comment id="16172917" author="ustas" created="Wed, 20 Sep 2017 08:48:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I observed the same behavior also for non concurrent ALTER TABLE&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16172934" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Wed, 20 Sep 2017 09:07:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Root cause: use cached query at the &lt;tt&gt;IgniteH2Indexing#queryDistributedSqlFields&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
Proposal: the query cache &lt;tt&gt;IgniteH2Indexing#twoStepCache&lt;/tt&gt; must be reset or partially cleaned after add / remove columns.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
